{{!--
    The homepage hero — the other half of the header module.

    Five appearances, from the same header_style setting the bar uses, because
    on two of them the bar sits inside this block rather than above it.

      Rule       words, centred, no media
      Plate      words, centred, no media (the bar is what differs)
      Split      words left, publication cover right
      Cover      the cover image behind the whole band, words over a scrim
      Broadcast  a looping video behind the band, scanlines over it

    Everything is built from what the publisher already filled in: logo, title,
    description, cover image, social accounts. Only the call to action and the
    video URL are theme settings.

    Every variant degrades. Cover with no cover image, and Broadcast with no
    video URL, both render as the plain centred hero rather than leaving a hole
    or a grey rectangle — which is the state a brand-new Ghost is in.
--}}
{{#match @custom.header_style "Split"}}
    {{#if @site.cover_image}}{{> "hero-body" variant="split"}}{{else}}{{> "hero-body" variant="plain"}}{{/if}}
{{else match @custom.header_style "Cover"}}
    {{#if @site.cover_image}}{{> "hero-body" variant="cover"}}{{else}}{{> "hero-body" variant="plain"}}{{/if}}
{{else match @custom.header_style "Broadcast"}}
    {{#if @custom.hero_video_url}}{{> "hero-body" variant="broadcast"}}{{else}}{{> "hero-body" variant="plain"}}{{/if}}
{{else}}
    {{> "hero-body" variant="plain"}}
{{/match}}
